WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.300 --> 00:00:03.597
Here is how to set up MoyMote, from the
Store to your first command.

2
00:00:04.397 --> 00:00:14.382
Open the Microsoft Store on your Windows ten
or eleven PC and search for MoyMote. Install
it. It comes with a seven day free trial,
and nothing is charged unless you buy.

3
00:00:15.182 --> 00:00:25.817
Open MoyMote from the Start menu. A first
screen asks how you want to control your
monitor: from this computer, or with your
phone. After that, it sits in the tray next
to your clock.

4
00:00:26.617 --> 00:00:35.301
Click the little arrow in the tray, next to
your clock, then right click the MoyMote
icon and choose Pair phone. A QR code
appears on your screen.

5
00:00:36.101 --> 00:00:48.779
Connect your phone to the same Wi-Fi and
scan the QR code with its camera. The
control panel opens in your phone's browser.
There is no app to install. Do not share the
code, it gives access to this computer.

6
00:00:49.579 --> 00:00:57.613
If you have more than one monitor, choose
which display to control, or pick all
displays. Each monitor shows only the
controls it supports.

7
00:00:58.413 --> 00:01:09.326
Now try your first command. Drag the
brightness slider on your phone and watch
your monitor change. You can also adjust
blue light, or turn HDR on or off, if your
monitor supports it.

8
00:01:10.126 --> 00:01:15.502
Done. Need help? Email support at moymote
dot com.
